<title>USA: Hambrecht &amp; Quist sets 2.0 mln shr buyback.</title>
<headline>Hambrecht &amp; Quist sets 2.0 mln shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hambrecht &amp; Quist Group on Monday said it board of directors has approved a plan to repurchase up to two million shares of its common stock, primarily to fund equity-based compensation programs.</p>
<p>Under the program, the company may purchase shares from time to time through open-market and privately negotiated deals. The duration of the program is open-ended.</p>
</text>
